### Token Feature UI Routes Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000/token

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/token
@tokenId = 123
@label = My API Token

### 1. Generate Token (Full Permissions)
POST {{baseUrl}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "{{label}}",
  "can_create": true,
  "can_update": true,
  "can_delete": true
}

###

### 2. Generate Token (Read Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Read Only Token",
  "can_create": false,
  "can_update": false,
  "can_delete": false
}

###

### 3. Generate Token (Create and Update Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Create & Update Token",
  "can_create": true,
  "can_update": true,
  "can_delete": false
}

###

### 4. Generate Token (Create Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Create Only Token",
  "can_create": true,
  "can_update": false,
  "can_delete": false
}

###

### 5. Get Tokens Page
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 6. Update Token
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{tokenId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Updated Token Label",
  "can_create": true,
  "can_update": false,
  "can_delete": true
}

###

### 7. Regenerate Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{tokenId}}/regenerate
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 8. Delete Token
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{tokenId}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 9. Test with Empty Label (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "",
  "can_create": true,
  "can_update": true,
  "can_delete": true
}

###

### 10. Test with Label Too Long (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "This is a very long label that exceeds the maximum allowed length of 100 characters and should cause validation to fail",
  "can_create": true,
  "can_update": true,
  "can_delete": true
}

###

### 11. Test with Invalid Token ID (should fail)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/invalid-id
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "{{label}}",
  "can_create": true,
  "can_update": true,
  "can_delete": true
}

###

### 12. Test with Missing Required Fields (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "{{label}}"
}

###

### 13. Test Regenerate with Invalid Token ID (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/invalid-id/regenerate
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 14. Test Delete with Invalid Token ID (should fail)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/invalid-id
Content-Type: application/json

###
